docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  index.ts,project,readStdin contract
close_reason: fixed
body: "The chunk boundary is an artefact of how the kernel filled the pipe, not of the data. Any decode that treats a chunk as a complete unit inherits that arbitrariness. A streaming decoder holds the incomplete tail until the next chunk supplies it, which is the only way the result is a function of the input alone."
